  "definition": "Renewals of License",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-12-17",
  "historyNote": "#2130, eff 8-30-82; amd by #2474, eff 9-12-83; ss by #2847, eff 9-19-84, EXPIRED: 9-19-90 New. #5573, eff 2-11-93; amd by #6718, eff 3-24-98; amd by #7163, INTERIM, eff 12-18-99, EXPIRED: 4-16-00 New. #7265, eff 5-6-00; ss by #7521, eff 6-28-01; ss by #9301, eff 10-22-08, EXPIRED: 10-22-16 New. #12067, INTERIM, eff 12-21-16, EXPIRES: 6-19-17; ss by #12213, eff 6-18-17; ss by #12977-B, eff 1-23-20; ss by #13464, eff 12-17-22",
